  <p style="color: brown; font-style: italic; font-size: 0.85em;">This is me on 'l'Ile aux Moines', in France (August 26')</p>
   <br/> 
  This is me, Osgood ! I was born in 2000 in France. <br/> I am in love with life in general and my blog is the only place where maybe I do not feel guilty to to talk about me ;)
  <br/> I am really interested in creating music, travelling around the world in the least impactful way, gliding sports, humans and their emotional intelligence and getting out of my comfort zone ! 
  <br/> On a less funny side, I hold two Master's degrees, one from Télécom SudParis in Computer Science (2023) and one from Institut Polytechnique de Paris in Nuclear Science (2025). 
  <br/> You can read some of the  <a href="/articles" style="font-style: bold">weird stuff</a> I write, see some of  <a href="/gallery" style="font-style: bold">my pictures</a> and get to <a href="/map" style="font-style: bold"> travel</a>  with me !
